("A married taxpayer living with her spouse wants the premium tax credit. Except in cases such as domestic abuse, she must:",
 "File a joint return", ["File separately", "File as head of household", "File as single"],
 "Married taxpayers must file jointly to claim the premium tax credit. Victims of domestic abuse or spousal abandonment may claim it filing separately if they meet the rules."),
